      "native_category": "",
      "description": "Confocal Laser Scanning Microscope (CLSM) + fluorescent probes for local pH assessment in alkaline media in GDE configuration\nOwner: ICPEES@CNRS/Unistra:Tristan Asset, Paul Chassagne\nTask: T1.2\nMaturity: under development\nDocumentation: DOI: 10.1039/d3cp00938f (see Figure 2b)\nRange of validity or processability: \nIn pH, a 0.05 variation should be visible with a ratiometric probe; Spatial resolution is bound to the light and correction factors, i.e., 200 nm (in all directions). The current pH range is ca. 7 - 12.\ninternal key: Confocal Laser Scanning Microscope (CLSM) + fluorescent probes for local pH assessment in alkaline media in GDE configuration0",
